# Dataset

## Dataset Overview

This project uses a simulated e-commerce dataset from Tokopaedi, provided as part of the MySkill Fullstack Data Analysis Final Project.

The dataset consists of six tables containing information about orders, products, customers, payments, transactions, and marketing funnels.

### Dataset Tables

| Table Name | Description |
|---|---|
| customer_detail | Customer profile and registration information |
| funnel_detail | Customer funnel events and conversion information |
| order_detail | Order and product-level transaction information |
| payment_detail | Payment method information |
| product_detail | Product attributes, categories, brands, and COGS |
| transaction_detail | Transaction-level financial information |

### File Format

The original dataset files are provided in TXT format.

These datasets are used as the source data for SQL exploration, data preparation, and business case analysis.

**Note:** The dataset is simulated and does not represent actual Tokopedia transactions.
